      "writtenOn": "2025-08-06T15:36:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the design is that we want to record 3,4,6,7. If there\u0027s a bug in maybe pipeline state set / pipeline cache hit / bindgroup tracker that\u0027s the way to get it reproduced in recording.\n\nFor recording of the async of the future event, currently I haven\u0027t implemented anything in the code. I did have some thoughts (in design doc) that record the async function invocations as usual, record their in their callback for completes. When playback, playback async function invocations no block, playback their completes as the record appears in the order of cmds in the serialized file",
